   ],
   "duration": 14.536,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "That same format's own documentation also names exactly what run-length encoding itself is doing underneath.",
     "start": 0.15,
     "end": 7.546
    },
    {
     "text": "It combines bit-packing together with run-length encoding, to store those repeated values far more efficiently.",
